  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chadiza DFA Cooking Oil Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2014 the Chadiza DFA received an Enterprise Development Investment (EDI) grant from the United States African Development Foundation (USADF) in order to strengthen its management and operational capacity to be able to produce and market cooking oil from sunflower in an effort to sustain the operations of the association. Based on experience during the EDI the association is now requesting for further USADF support to enable it to expand its current business operations focusing on increased seed/ crop purchase fund, additional oil expeller/ filter, construction of holding/ distribution facility and transportation to facilitate movement of raw materials and cooking oil.</narrative>
  </description>
